      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.39",
      "en": "Comprehensive support across operating systems and access protocols",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.4",
      "en": "Electros is Elemento Cloud's orchestration dashboard—available as a native desktop app for Linux, macOS, and Windows. It provides cohesive visibility, provisioning, and remote access for workloads across any integrated infrastructure.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.40",
      "en": "No account yet? Register first. Already have one? Open Buy a seat to purchase for an organisation.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.41",
      "en": "Register to create your Elemento account and personal organisation. You get a 14-day Electros trial (once per account). After that, come back here to buy a seat.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.42",
      "en": "Sign in with email and password, pick the organisation that should hold the seat, choose a plan, then pay in Stripe.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.43",
      "en": "New accounts get a 14-day free trial once. Each organisation includes one Electros seat — buy a seat after you sign in.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.44",
      "en": "Once per Elemento account. When you sign up, we create your organisation with one Electros seat so you can start immediately.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.45",
      "en": "During or after the trial, open Buy a seat, pick an organisation and plan, then complete Stripe checkout. One seat is valid in one organisation.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.46",
      "en": "Common questions about Electros functionality",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.47",
      "en": "If you do not have an Elemento account yet, create one first — you get an organisation and a 14-day free trial. If you already have an account, open Buy a seat to purchase for an organisation via Stripe.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "body.electros.p.48",
      "en": "On the Buy a seat page, sign in, choose an organisation and plan, then Stripe opens in your browser. Subscribe during the trial so you do not lose access when it ends.",
      "it": "",
      "fr": "",
      "source": "electros.html",
      "context": "<p>"
    },
    {
